# Upstream: giac 2.1.0 intg.cc _integrate_ and solve.cc _fsolve: the variable of a definite integral or of fsolve runs as a fresh name whatever the name holds. At Digits 40 a name holding BesselJ(1,2) unevaluated made int(y^2,y,0,1) and fsolve(y^2=2,y,1) fail with Bad Argument Value; a name holding a float gave int(y^2,y,0,a) = 0.
